      "side": 1,
      "message": "What do you mean \"both of these\"? - Did you intend to +1 this? An LGTM would be welcome as this change is needed to unblock activating fontations for COLRv0/COLRv1 in Chromium and implements the treatment of OOB `base_palette` analogously to what we\u0027re doing in the FreeType backend, compare:\nhttps://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/skia/src/ports/SkFontHost_FreeType.cpp;l\u003d332?q\u003dskfonthost%20freetype",
